Comment: 0,0:23:10.68,0:23:16.29,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}深い喜びが待っているんだろう
Comment: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:22.28,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}いつもこの胸に咲き溢(こぼ)れる笑顔を
Comment: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:27.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}守るため同じ空へ
Comment: 0,0:23:28.25,0:23:33.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}迷いのない軌跡重ねて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.28,0:22:22.33,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}在延续无尽梦想的旅途中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.11,0:22:28.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}尝试窥见尚未知晓的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:34.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}尽管不知会见到伙伴笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:40.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}还是绝望抑或是愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:46.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}不论多么热切期望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.04,0:22:51.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}都无法回到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.85,0:22:58.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}所以至少现在就用这双手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.45,0:23:02.34,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}建构未来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.46,0:23:05.54,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}在终将抵达的遥远彼端之地
Comment: 0,0:23:10.68,0:23:16.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}有着莫大喜悦在等待吧
Comment: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:22.28,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}为了守护总是绽放于心中的笑容
Comment: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:27.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}而朝向同一片天空
Comment: 0,0:23:28.25,0:23:33.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.8\blur8\fad(150,150)}重叠上坚定不移的轨迹
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.28,0:22:22.33,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}果てなき夢　続く旅の途中
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.11,0:22:28.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}まだ見えぬ明日を覗いてみる
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.45,0:22:34.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}そこにあるのは仲間の笑顔か
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.04,0:22:40.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}絶望か怒りかわからないけど
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.09,0:22:46.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}どれほど熱く希(こいねが)っても
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.04,0:22:51.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}過去には戻れないから
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.85,0:22:58.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}せめて未来だけはこの手で今
